cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference Automatos AI in academic work, please cite it as follows."
title: "Automatos AI"
abstract: >
  Automatos OS is the open-source engine of Automatos AI for building and
  deploying autonomous AI agents; Automatos Studio is the hosted app (hosted
  beta opens November 2026). It provides multi-agent orchestration with
  agents, skills, playbooks, missions, a marketplace, semantic field memory
  and an EU AI Act posture (work in progress).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kavanagh
    given-names: Gerard
    affiliation: "Automatos AI"
url: "https://automatos.app"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AutomatosAI/automatos-ai"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - autonomous agents
  - AI orchestration
  - LLM platform
  - semantic memory
  - EU AI Act
